  "description": "CloudFront edge for send.tb-dev.thunderbird.dev. All AWS/CloudFront and AWS/Route53 metrics are us-east-1 only, so every query overrides the region on the eu-central-1-default tb-dev CloudWatch datasource. Unlike the appointment dashboard, Cache Hit Rate and Origin Latency read real data: the per-distribution MonitoringSubscription shipped with platform-infrastructure #895.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "asDropdown": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tags": [],
      "targetBlank": true,
      "title": "Issue #1043 — Send edge dashboard, alerts and synthetic check",
      "tooltip": "",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/thunderbird/platform-infrastructure/issues/1043"
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### Send CloudFront edge — tb-dev (account 718959508124)\n\nCloudFront is a global service: **all `AWS/CloudFront` metrics are published in us-east-1 only**, as is `AWS/Route53 HealthCheckStatus`. Every query here overrides the datasource region to `us-east-1` (the `CloudWatch Logs — tb-dev01` datasource defaults to `eu-central-1`).\n\nUnlike the appointment edge dashboard, **nothing here is expected to be empty for want of a prerequisite**: the distribution `E1O1C4QY9LB2MO`, its `MonitoringSubscription` (which is what makes **Cache Hit Rate** and **Origin Latency** publish), all three certificates and the Route53 health check are live (platform-infrastructure https://github.com/thunderbird/platform-infrastructure/issues/895 and https://github.com/thunderbird/platform-infrastructure/issues/1052), and the cross-account `mzla-tb-dev-grafana-cloudwatch` role holds `cloudwatch:GetMetricData`/`ListMetrics` on `\"*\"` (https://github.com/thunderbird/platform-infrastructure/issues/951). An empty panel therefore means no traffic in the window, not a missing grant.\n\nThe **Distribution** picker is a `dimension_values` query whose default value and filter regex are rendered from the Terraform variable `send_distribution_id`, so the dashboard opens on the Send distribution and can never silently default to another distribution in the account.\n\nCache hit rate is the success metric for this edge: a caching distribution that is not caching is a pure extra hop. Read it **per cache behaviour** — the deliberately-uncached `/api/*` behaviour drags the distribution-wide aggregate down.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "Prerequisites and how to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Traffic",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${cloudwatch_tb_dev_uid}"
      },
      "description": "Total viewer requests served by the distribution (all edge locations). CloudFront publishes only Sum for this metric.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${cloudwatch_tb_dev_uid}"
          },
          "dimensions": {
            "DistributionId": "$distribution_id",
            "Region": "Global"
          },
          "expression": "",
          "id": "",
          "legendFormat": "Requests",
          "matchExact": true,
          "metricEditorMode": 0,
          "metricName": "Requests",
          "metricQueryType": 0,
          "namespace": "AWS/CloudFront",
          "period": "300",
          "queryMode": "Metrics",
          "refId": "A",
          "region": "us-east-1",
          "statistic": "Sum"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Requests",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
