      },
      "description": "Percentage (0-100) of viewer requests served from the edge cache. THE success metric for this distribution. Published because the per-distribution MonitoringSubscription is live (platform-infrastructure #895). Read per cache behaviour: the uncached /api/* behaviour drags the distribution-wide aggregate down, so this is not a naive \">90%\" target.",
      "fieldConfig": {
