      },
      "description": "Percentage (0-100) of Route53 checkers reporting the endpoint healthy. Unlike the aggregate Status to the left, this moves before the 18% threshold flips, so a regional edge failure is visible here first. Alerted on at < 75% for 15m in terraform/alerting-send-edge.tf.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
